sangati tvam

  "sparsha-swarupa dipaka-kriya pratibodha-yukta"
  "dampati-abheda rati-janya prema-samsarga-yukta"
  "ananda-sthita prema-samsarga-siddha brahman-drishthanta"
  "tirodhana-drishthanta avahana-abheda"

  shabda dampati, rati, prema-samsarga, ananda, love, brahman, sparsha, darshana, zha, you

done
